{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301301","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301301","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1830130101:1":{"text":"상회 건물 밑에 폭탄이라도 묻혀 있었나? 왜 갑자기 폭발한 거야? 건물 전체가 무너졌잖아!","source_cn":"商会楼下是埋了颗炸弹吗，为什么会突然爆炸？整栋大楼都塌了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF418D578375F82D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830130102:1":{"text":"알 게 뭐야... 어쨌든 우린 빠져나왔잖아! 난 아직 그레이브본이 되고 싶진 않다고!","source_cn":"管他呢……反正咱们逃出来了！我可还不想变成亡灵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17449ABBD3301CAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830130103:1":{"text":"그럼 내일도 출근해?","source_cn":"那明天还上班吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC9C58222B6740F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830130104:1":{"text":"무슨 출근? 자리도 없어졌는데 어디로 출근하려고?","source_cn":"上什么班？工位都没了，你还要去哪上班？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x641B296D21650035","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830130105:1":{"text":"그렇네! 드디어 자유야! 사장님, 한 잔 더요!","source_cn":"太棒了！我等的就是这句话！老板，再来一杯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x764F161E59F450D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docu